# The table editor, one session on the test's table (tests/t1/pinball3d_editor.sh), window 1440x900. A line is `<frame> <event>`.
# Things are reached on the top view, whose place does not depend on the format; a field is reached by its key.
# The bumper pop3 is dragged 3 cm to the right and 3 cm down the table.
4 move 583 394
5 down
6 move 590 400
7 move 603 414
8 up
# The left flipper is selected on the table; its speed, which is its strength, is found by its key (Cmd+F, the key, Tab) and typed.
11 move 521 743
12 down
13 up
15 key f meta
16 text speed
17 key Tab
18 text 2600
19 key Enter
# The wall beside the spinner is selected; its surface is found the same way and chosen in the list of the table's surfaces, which
# opens under the only line shown.
23 move 697 361
24 down
25 up
27 key f meta
28 text surface
30 move 1315 112
31 down
32 up
34 move 1300 216
35 down
36 up
# Save.
38 key s meta
